# under a private name the slot itself says who has the name: a value that does not fit has nowhere to go, so the walk builds no typed form under a name that some store may move out of its slot, and what is closed there is a call of the run time.
# so the slot of a private name is held to nothing, and its definition and its stores stay typed though nothing is known of `raw`. `label` beside it is the control: it is written, and held.
